  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to <br>the boil.<br>• Peel potato and cut into large chunks.<br>• Cook potato in the boiling water until easily pierced <br>with a fork, 12-15 minutes. Drain and return to <br>the pan.<br>• Add the milk and half the butter to the potato.<br>Mash until smooth and season to taste with salt and <br>pepper. Cover to keep warm.<br>TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato <br>unpeeled! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689beef806d399ea41bc0243/step-17d96500.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic and brown onion.<br>• Trim green beans.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689beef806d399ea41bc0243/step-d8d62310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over <br>high heat. Cook green beans, tossing, until tender, <br>5-6 minutes.<br>• Add half the garlic and cook until fragrant, <br>1 minute. Season to taste, transfer to a bowl and <br>cover to keep warm. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689beef806d399ea41bc0243/step-10fa8d20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Wipe out the frying pan, then return to high heat <br>with a generous drizzle of olive oil. Cook <br>sliced mushrooms, tossing, until browned,<br>3-4 minutes.<br>• Add onion and cook, stirring, until tender, <br>4-5 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689beef806d399ea41bc0243/step-4d6fe930.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Add tomato paste, garlic &amp; herb seasoning, <br>remaining garlic and remaining butter and cook <br>until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.<br>• Add thickened cream, stock concentrate, Dijon <br>mustard and the water and cook until slightly <br>thickened, 2-3 minutes. Season to taste. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689beef806d399ea41bc0243/step-cd71c240.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide mashed potato between bowls.<br>• Top with creamy mushroom stroganoff.<br>• Serve with garlicky greens. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689beef806d399ea41bc0243/step-5dba4f50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
